# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Added 2026-09-21 (Phase 0 — protect the working tree before implementation).
# These are build caches and session scratch. `git add -A` without them sweeps
# ~27,500 Go build-cache files into the repository.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Go build/test caches from containerised and local verification runs
.tmp-go-cache/
.tmp-go-tmp/
.tmp-final-local-go-cache/
.tmp-final-local-go-tmp/
.tmp-nxb21d-q4-qualification-go-tmp/
.tmp-nxb21d-qwen3-8b-selection-go-tmp/
.gotmp/

# Agent / editor session scratch (never shared state — see NEXUSAI_CONTINUATION.md)
.scratch3/
.claude/
.pytest_cache/

# Session working scratch: run logs, one-off adjudication scripts, lockfiles.
# Anything here that proved durable belongs in scripts/ or reports/ instead.
/tmp/

# Generated document output (regenerate from source; evidence lives in reports/)
/output/

# Compiled binaries captured inside report build-context dirs (8 x ~9 MB copies
# of the same Go wrapper). The reports are evidence; the binaries are build
# artifacts and are reproducible from source.
reports/**/build-context/nexusai-ui-wrapper
reports/**/context/nexusai-ui-wrapper

apps/investigation-workspace/design-review/**/*.png
apps/investigation-workspace/fixtures/live-*/
